      VFX_PASSDEPTH == VFX_PASSDEPTH_ACTUAL\n\t\t\t\t\t\t#ifdef WRITE_MSAA_DEPTH\n\t\t\t\t\t\t//
      We need the depth color as SV_Target0 for alpha to coverage\n\t\t\t\t\t\t,
